<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria details 9-mth results.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria details 9-mth results.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						     1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Parent operating			  3,618   vs   3,292</p>
<p>    Parent interest surplus		 9,247   vs   8,986</p>
<p>    Parent commission surplus	     2,179   vs   2,073</p>
<p>    Parent operating costs		  9,686   vs   9,411</p>
<p>    Parent trading income		     899   vs     661</p>
<p>    Parent balance sheet total (billion)  720.2   up 6 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Balance sheet total compares with end-1995. Results and costs compare with the first nine months of 1995 -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
